  "notes": "{気|き}にする means to actively mind or care about something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {気|き}にしないで (don't worry about it)\n- {気|き}にしない (not to care)\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{気|き}にする (to care about ~)\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{気|き}にする (care about others' opinions)\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{気|き}になる→気になる：03027_kininaru⟧:\n- {気|き}にする: actively choosing to worry/care (volitional)\n- ⟦{気|き}になる→気になる：03027_kininaru⟧: something weighing on mind (non-volitional)\n\nCOMMON PHRASE:\n{気|き}にしないで is a common way to say \"don't worry\" or \"never mind\".",
